{"id":"n85220-1-8","stage":5,"title":"하객 · 贺客","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85220-1-8-1","ko":"어제 결혼식 잘 다녀왔니?","zh":"昨天去参加婚礼，怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"결혼식","meaning":"婚礼","explanation":"결혼식：婚礼","readings":[{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31666","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀왔니?","meaning":"去一趟，去了趟","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去了趟；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀왔니","audio":"/audio/e11859b5f26fc6916e9e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"95cfb1a60ed967ea","term":"결혼식","zh":"婚礼","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3","entryId":"31666","definition":"宣告成人男女成为法定夫妻的仪式。","pronunciation":["결혼식"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去了趟","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c507a919d1d489147a2f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85220-1-8-2","ko":"응. 하객들의 축하를 받으면서 수줍게 웃는 신랑 신부의 모습이 참 예쁘더라.","zh":"很好。新郎新娘在宾客祝福中羞涩微笑的样子真好看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"하객들의","meaning":"贺客，宾客","explanation":"하객：贺客，宾客；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"하객","audio":"/audio/ccff7e6cb89f2d12ba7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85220","senseId":"1","lemma":"하객","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하객들의","audio":"/audio/4f3cd7b5b2439d70ddd2.mp3"}},{"text":"축하를","meaning":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","explanation":"축하：祝贺，庆贺，道贺；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"축하","audio":"/audio/02fbd137536a81840667.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72137","senseId":"1","lemma":"축하","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축하를","audio":"/audio/66b0d119ced819be6ba7.mp3"}},{"text":"받으면서","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；으면서：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받으면서","audio":"/audio/bacbc87f028bd15d9154.mp3"}},{"text":"수줍게","meaning":"害羞，羞涩","explanation":"수줍다：害羞，羞涩；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"수줍다","audio":"/audio/e331030d836e5cc12902.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65474","senseId":"1","lemma":"수줍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수줍게","audio":"/audio/18391a5c42fb3c96b66a.mp3"}},{"text":"웃는","meaning":"笑",